@startuml
!include style.iuml
title Tiga tahap perjalanan calon pelanggan di CRM kita
left to right direction
rectangle "**LEAD**\n(belum tentu layak)\n\nPertanyaan: layakkah\njadi Opportunity?\n\nPenanda: **status kerja**\nmis. Connected" as A #dde6fa
rectangle "**OPPORTUNITY**\n(ada kebutuhan nyata)\n\nPertanyaan: bagaimana\nposisi pembeli?\n\nPenanda: **stage**\nmis. Demo" as B #cfe3ff
rectangle "**CUSTOMER**\n(Closed-Won)\n\nPertanyaan: berapa\nnilai yang dimenangkan?\n\nPenanda: **Revenue**" as C #dff4ea
rectangle "**Lost**\n(dengan alasan)" as L #fde8e6
A -[#0a7a54,bold]-> B : Convert
B -[#0a7a54,bold]-> C : Closed-Won
A -[#b42318]-> L
B -[#b42318]-> L : Closed-Lost
L -[#122e7c,dashed]-> A : buka kembali\n(Nurturing)
note bottom of A
  HubSpot menyebut ini "lifecycle stage"
  (Lead → Opportunity → Customer).
  Di CRM kita tahap ini = jenis record,
  jadi tidak perlu properti terpisah.
end note
@enduml
